容赦なさすぎる！
You're way too relentless!

597
00:43:39,598 --> 00:43:44,098
はいはいはい！楽しそう、楽しそう！
Alright, alright, alright! Looks like fun!

598
00:43:44,598 --> 00:43:49,098
ゼータ！え？何？何で水鉄砲持ってるの？
Zeta! Huh? What? Why do you have water guns?

599
00:43:49,598 --> 00:43:54,598
やめて！やめて！やめて！
Stop it! Stop it! Stop it!

600
00:43:56,098 --> 00:44:03,098
うわ！持ってるやん！
Whoa! You have one too!

601
00:44:03,598 --> 00:44:07,398
どういうこと？誰か説明して〜！
What's going on? Someone explain~!

602
00:44:08,598 --> 00:44:14,098
Bokobokobo~ Kobo Kanaeru at your service! Let me be your sun to shine your day! Ehei!

603
00:44:14,598 --> 00:44:18,098
Zeta, happy birthday! ありがとう〜！
Zeta, happy birthday! Thank you~!

604
00:44:18,598 --> 00:44:23,098
I already told them what to do before you came here, so they know the rules!

605
00:44:23,598 --> 00:44:27,098
この水鉄砲で君のエイム力を確かめるよ！
We're gonna be testing your aim skills with this water gun!

606
00:44:27,598 --> 00:44:32,798
In shooting level 1, we will see how many immobile targets you can hit within 30 seconds!

607
00:44:33,098 --> 00:44:37,798
In level 2, we will see how many moving targets you can hit within 30 seconds!

608
00:44:38,098 --> 00:44:42,598
And level 3 will test if you can hit the targets on the moving zombie!

609
00:44:43,098 --> 00:44:47,098
誰が最強のエイム力を持っているかなー？
Who do you think has the best aim skills here?

610
00:44:47,598 --> 00:44:50,598
はい！俺だ！
Me! It's me!

611
00:44:50,698 --> 00:44:55,798
トワたち、みんな何とFPSやってるんだよね！
Towa and the others all play FPS games!

612
00:44:56,098 --> 00:45:00,598
そうだねー！私はやってないけどね！余裕や余裕！
That's right! Though I don't play them! Easy peasy!

613
00:45:01,139 --> 00:45:02,339
頑張ろう！
Let's do our best!

614
00:45:02,339 --> 00:45:04,439
誰が勝つんでしょうかという感じなんですか？
So it's a question of who will win, huh?

615
00:45:04,439 --> 00:45:05,739
負けませんよ
I won't lose!

616
00:45:05,739 --> 00:45:07,939
私も負けないよー
I won't lose either~

617
00:45:08,139 --> 00:45:10,639
Level 1

618
00:45:11,139 --> 00:45:12,439
提らに...
Over here...

619
00:45:12,439 --> 00:45:16,239
動かない標的があるので、こちらをみんなで1人ずつ撃っていこうかなと思います
there are stationary targets, so let's each take turns shooting them.

620
00:45:16,239 --> 00:45:17,639
頑張るー！
I'll do my best!

621
00:45:17,739 --> 00:45:18,939
順番どうしましょう？
How should we decide the turn order?

622
00:45:18,939 --> 00:45:23,339
やりたい！やりたい！
I wanna go! I wanna go!

623
00:45:23,639 --> 00:45:25,539
まつりちゃんは言い出しっぺだし
Since Matsuri-chan suggested it first,

624
00:45:25,539 --> 00:45:28,939
撃たない3人にはね、ここら辺で見てもらいましょう
the three of us who aren't shooting will watch from around here.

625
00:45:28,939 --> 00:45:29,939
はーい
Okay!

626
00:45:29,939 --> 00:45:31,939
3, 2, 1

627
00:45:31,939 --> 00:45:33,539
スタート！
Start!

628
00:45:34,339 --> 00:45:35,639
うま！
So good!

629
00:45:35,639 --> 00:45:38,139
ごめん！
Sorry!

630
00:45:38,639 --> 00:45:40,639
外してなくない？
Isn't she not missing at all?

631
00:45:40,639 --> 00:45:42,339
まつさんがパーフェクト...
Matsu-san is getting a perfect score...

632
00:45:42,339 --> 00:45:44,139
パーフェクトおじさんじゃない？
Isn't she "Perfect Ojisan"?

633
00:45:45,339 --> 00:45:46,439
やば！
Crazy!

634
00:45:46,439 --> 00:45:48,439
うますぎる！
She's way too good!

635
00:45:49,139 --> 00:45:50,739
残り15秒！
15 seconds remaining!

636
00:45:50,739 --> 00:45:52,139
えー！？
Whaaa?!

637
00:45:51,639 --> 00:45:54,139
これみんなには分かんないけど、数字すら見えないこれ
Everyone might not realize, but you can't even see the numbers from here.

638
00:45:54,139 --> 00:45:56,139
すごい！偏差とかもなしに
Amazing! Without even adjusting for lead distance!

639
00:45:56,139 --> 00:45:57,139
え、これ最後？
Wait, is this the last one?

640
00:45:57,139 --> 00:45:58,339
えー？！
Whaaat?!

641
00:45:58,339 --> 00:45:59,639
あと1個！あと1個！
One more! One more!

642
00:45:59,639 --> 00:46:02,139
おー！
Woah!

643
00:46:02,339 --> 00:46:04,139
ノーミス！
Flawless!

644
00:46:04,139 --> 00:46:06,139
え、すごーい！
Woah, amazing!

645
00:46:06,139 --> 00:46:07,639
ノーミス！
Flawless!

646
00:46:07,639 --> 00:46:11,639
まつりちゃん一発も外さずすべて取れました！
Matsuri-chan didn't miss a single shot and got them all!

647
00:46:11,639 --> 00:46:13,139
いやー！
Yay!

648
00:46:13,139 --> 00:46:15,139
うますぎるよね！
She's way too good!

649
00:46:15,139 --> 00:46:17,139
うますぎるよね。なんかちょっと行きづらいわ
She's so good that it's kinda intimidating to go next.

650
00:46:17,139 --> 00:46:18,339
私行く？
Should I go?

651
00:46:18,339 --> 00:46:19,939
お、マジ？
Oh, really?

652
00:46:19,939 --> 00:46:22,939
吾輩でしょ、次。吾輩！
It's my turn next, right? Mine!

653
00:46:22,939 --> 00:46:24,639
あ、トワ様か
Ah, Towa-sama?

654
00:46:24,639 --> 00:46:25,639
じゃあトワ！
Then Towa!

655
00:46:25,639 --> 00:46:26,639
頑張れー！
Do your best!

656
00:46:26,639 --> 00:46:28,639
支える、支える感じで行こう
Let's go with a supporting grip.

657
00:46:28,639 --> 00:46:30,639
じゃあ、カウントするね
Okay, I'll count down!

658
00:46:32,639 --> 00:46:34,939
3, 2, 1

659
00:46:34,939 --> 00:46:36,139
スタート！
Start!

660
00:46:36,139 --> 00:46:37,139
ここ！
Here!

661
00:46:37,639 --> 00:46:38,639
ここ！
Here!

662
00:46:39,939 --> 00:46:41,639
おー！速い！速い！
Ooh! Fast! Fast!

663
00:46:42,639 --> 00:46:44,139
ここ！
Here!

664
00:46:44,139 --> 00:46:45,339
速い！
Fast!

665
00:46:45,339 --> 00:46:48,139
警察だ！はい、警察！
It's the police! Yes, police!

666
00:46:48,139 --> 00:46:49,639
え、え？
Huh, wait what?

667
00:46:49,639 --> 00:46:52,639
うまい、うまい！めっちゃ速い！
Good, good! Extremely fast!

668
00:46:52,639 --> 00:46:54,139
ここ！
Here!

669
00:46:54,139 --> 00:46:56,639
え、うまっ！ここ！
Whoa, skill! Here!

670
00:46:56,639 --> 00:47:00,139
うわあー！
Woah!

671
00:47:01,139 --> 00:47:02,939
だんだん超えてくるんだ、これ
The pressure keeps mounting with each person!

672
00:47:02,939 --> 00:47:04,339
これは...
This is...

673
00:47:04,339 --> 00:47:05,639
次どうする？
What should we do next?

674
00:47:05,639 --> 00:47:07,139
いやー！
Oh no~

675
00:47:07,139 --> 00:47:09,139
先やった方がいい！先やった方がいい！
Better to go sooner! Better to go sooner!

676
00:47:09,139 --> 00:47:11,639
とりあえずね！とりあえずね！
For now, yeah! For now!

677
00:47:12,139 --> 00:47:15,139
下半身作戦！下半身作戦！
Lower body tactic! Lower body tactic!

678
00:47:15,139 --> 00:47:18,139
下半身を安定させる！ぶれないようにする！
Stabilize the lower body so you don't sway!

679
00:47:19,139 --> 00:47:21,139
ポーズダッセぇ！
That pose looks so lame!

680
00:47:21,139 --> 00:47:23,139
ダサすぎる！これで行くから！
Way too lame! But I'm going with this!

681
00:47:23,139 --> 00:47:25,639
3, 2, 1, どうぞ！
3, 2, 1, go ahead!

682
00:47:25,639 --> 00:47:27,139
ほら！
Look!

683
00:47:27,139 --> 00:47:29,139
頑張れー！
Do your best!

684
00:47:29,139 --> 00:47:31,139
頑張れ！
Do your best!

685
00:47:32,639 --> 00:47:34,139
安定させて！
Keep it stable!

686
00:47:34,139 --> 00:47:36,639
あ、いいよいいよ！当たってる！
Ah, good, good! It's hitting!

687
00:47:39,139 --> 00:47:42,639
適当に撃ってる！
She's just shooting blindly!

688
00:47:43,139 --> 00:47:45,139
あ、でも惜しい惜しい！
Ah, but close, close!

689
00:47:45,139 --> 00:47:47,639
空に...空に撃ってる！
Into the... She's shooting into the sky!

690
00:47:48,139 --> 00:47:50,639
もっと上！もっと上！
Higher! Higher!

691
00:47:51,139 --> 00:47:54,139
頑張れ！頑張れ！あ、それ空だぞ！
Do your best! Do your best! Ah, that's the sky!

692
00:47:59,139 --> 00:48:03,139
ラプラスの結果は...まあ、2個だな
Laplus's result is... well, 2 targets.

693
00:48:03,139 --> 00:48:05,139
イェーイ！
Yay!

694
00:48:05,139 --> 00:48:07,139
最後、行きますか！
Shall we go with the last one?

695
00:48:07,139 --> 00:48:09,139
行けー！頑張れー！
Go for it! Do your best!

696
00:48:09,139 --> 00:48:12,139
ということで、じゃあ最後ゼータ。打ち合わせね
So for the last one, Zeta. We had a strategy meeting,

697
00:48:12,139 --> 00:48:13,639
1秒で、1秒で
in 1 second, in 1 second!

698
00:48:13,639 --> 00:48:15,139
いやいやいや
No, no, no, no!

699
00:48:15,639 --> 00:48:17,939
準備OK？ 準備OK！
Are you ready? Ready!

700
00:48:17,939 --> 00:48:20,639
行くよ！ 3, 2, 1, Go!
Here we go! 3, 2, 1, Go!

701
00:48:21,639 --> 00:48:24,139
うわー！上手い上手い！
Whoa! So good, so good!

702
00:48:24,639 --> 00:48:26,139
うまい！
Good!

703
00:48:26,139 --> 00:48:28,639
3個目？上手い！
Third one? So good!

704
00:48:28,639 --> 00:48:30,139
思ってたより上手い！
Better than expected!

705
00:48:30,139 --> 00:48:32,139
上手いやん！
You're good!

706
00:48:32,139 --> 00:48:35,139
いや、これは...
Whoa, this is...

707
00:48:35,639 --> 00:48:38,139
ごめん
Sorry!

708
00:48:38,639 --> 00:48:40,639
全然余裕余裕！
Plenty of time, plenty of time!

709
00:48:40,639 --> 00:48:44,139
行けた！あ、ちょっと待って！
Got it! Ah, wait a second!

710
00:48:44,139 --> 00:48:45,139
どこだ？
Where is it?

711
00:48:45,139 --> 00:48:48,139
右、右、そこら辺！
Right, right, around there!

712
00:48:48,139 --> 00:48:50,139
下！下！下！
Down! Down! Down!

713
00:48:50,139 --> 00:48:52,139
どこにある？ どこだ？
Where is it? Where?

714
00:48:52,639 --> 00:48:54,139
あれ？
Huh?

715
00:48:54,139 --> 00:48:56,139
画面外だ！
It's off-screen!

716
00:48:56,139 --> 00:48:58,139
残った！
It stayed!

717
00:48:58,139 --> 00:49:00,139
すごい！神様が手伝ってくれた
Amazing! A god helped her out!

718
00:49:00,139 --> 00:49:02,139
まいっか！
Oh well!

719
00:49:03,139 --> 00:49:06,139
まつり先輩ナイスショット！
[Matsuri-senpai, nice shot!]

720
00:49:06,139 --> 00:49:08,639
なんかギリギリ滑り込みで、半端ないって！
That was barely in time, insane!

721
00:49:08,639 --> 00:49:11,139
イェーイ！
Yay!

722
00:49:12,139 --> 00:49:14,139
Level 2

723
00:49:14,139 --> 00:49:16,139
あちらをご覧ください！
Please look over there!

724
00:49:16,139 --> 00:49:18,139
はい！ 動いてる！
Yes! They're moving!

725
00:49:18,139 --> 00:49:21,139
動いてる！むちゃくちゃ！
They're moving! That's insane!

726
00:49:21,139 --> 00:49:23,139
はい、頑張っていきましょう！
Alright, let's do our best!

727
00:49:23,639 --> 00:49:25,639
じゃあ、誰から行く？
So who's going first?

728
00:49:25,639 --> 00:49:28,139
俺だ俺だ俺だ！
Me, me, me!

729
00:49:28,139 --> 00:49:30,139
我輩が行きたい！
I wanna go!

730
00:49:30,139 --> 00:49:33,139
もう行っちゃったから、じゃあラプラスからね
She already stepped up, so starting with Laplus then.

731
00:49:34,139 --> 00:49:36,139
やったもん勝ちでヤバい
Stepping up first to get it over with is crazy.

732
00:49:36,639 --> 00:49:39,139
では行きましょう！ラプラス、いきますよ！
Then let's go! Laplus, here I go!

733
00:49:39,639 --> 00:49:43,139
3, 2, 1, スタート！
3, 2, 1, start!

734
00:49:43,639 --> 00:49:46,139
このゲームには必勝法がある
There's a guaranteed winning strategy in this game.

735
00:49:46,139 --> 00:49:48,139
めっちゃ回っとるやん！
You're spinning like crazy!

736
00:49:48,139 --> 00:49:50,139
うわー！
Uwah!

737
00:49:51,139 --> 00:49:53,139
ねぇ、これズルい！
Hey, this is cheating!

738
00:49:53,139 --> 00:49:55,139
後ろから撃ってるのヤバいって！
Shooting from behind is insane!

739
00:49:55,139 --> 00:49:57,139
当たってないよ！
They're not hitting!

740
00:49:57,139 --> 00:49:59,139
当たってない！見て！
They're not hitting! Look!

741
00:49:59,139 --> 00:50:01,139
当たってないよ！
They're not hitting!

742
00:50:02,027 --> 00:50:03,427
腕、腕、腕、腕！
Arm, arm, arm, arm!

743
00:50:03,527 --> 00:50:05,327
ぐるんぐるんだから、カメラ！
The camera is spinning around!

744
00:50:07,427 --> 00:50:09,227
キミ、あと5秒しかないよ！
Hey, you only have 5 seconds left!

745
00:50:09,327 --> 00:50:10,527
1個しか倒せてないよ！
You've only hit one!

746
00:50:10,627 --> 00:50:11,927
ヤバい！頑張れ！
Oh no! Do your best!

747
00:50:14,127 --> 00:50:16,027
あ、でも1個... いいよ1個！
Ah, but you hit one, one is good!

748
00:50:16,227 --> 00:50:18,227
1個？あの、後ろ向きでね...
At least one? With your back turned...

749
00:50:18,627 --> 00:50:19,927
絶対行きたい！
I definitely want to go!

750
00:50:20,027 --> 00:50:21,927
絶対行きたい？行きたい、行きたい！
You definitely want to go? I do, I do!

751
00:50:22,027 --> 00:50:23,727
はい、じゃあござる行ってみましょう！
Okay, let's go with Gozaru!

752
00:50:23,827 --> 00:50:25,427
行ってみましょう！
Let me do this!

753
00:50:25,427 --> 00:50:27,027
イエーイ！
Yay!

754
00:50:27,127 --> 00:50:28,927
ラプラスみたいに後ろ向かなくていい？
Do I not need to face away like Laplus?

755
00:50:29,027 --> 00:50:30,227
ううん、大丈夫！
Nope, you're fine!

756
00:50:32,327 --> 00:50:34,427
それでは挑戦、行ってみましょう！
Now then, let's begin the challenge!

757
00:50:34,927 --> 00:50:37,927
3、2、1... スタート！
3, 2, 1... Start!

758
00:50:38,427 --> 00:50:40,327
これ... 頑張れ！
Do your best!

759
00:50:43,227 --> 00:50:45,127
当たってない！難し！
I'm not hitting them! So hard!

760
00:50:45,227 --> 00:50:47,427
難しい！むずい！
It's hard! So hard!

761
00:50:48,427 --> 00:50:50,427
いや、回ってるんだけど、私が...
No, I'm the one who's spinning...

762
00:50:50,627 --> 00:50:52,227
回ってる、回ってる！
You are spinning, you are spinning!

763
00:50:52,427 --> 00:50:53,727
回ってる！
Spinning!

764
00:50:53,927 --> 00:50:56,027
あ、当たった！当たった！
Ah, you hit it! You hit it!

765
00:50:56,927 --> 00:50:58,627
あ、裏面だったな...
Ah, that was the back side...

766
00:50:58,727 --> 00:51:00,427
裏面だったな...
It was the back side...

767
00:51:00,627 --> 00:51:02,027
ヤバい！
Oh no!

768
00:51:02,227 --> 00:51:03,727
後ろ、後ろ！
Behind, behind!

769
00:51:03,827 --> 00:51:05,627
これはもう後ろから...
This is already from behind...

770
00:51:07,427 --> 00:51:09,427
画面から...
From the screen...

771
00:51:11,727 --> 00:51:13,227
いや、惜しかった！
Ah, that was close!

772
00:51:13,427 --> 00:51:15,927
残念！0達成、0枚です！
Too bad! 0 targets hit!

773
00:51:16,027 --> 00:51:18,227
むちゃくちゃ... これむずいよ！
That's insane... This is so hard!

774
00:51:18,727 --> 00:51:20,727
いや、でも惜しかったのあったね！
But there were some close ones!

775
00:51:21,227 --> 00:51:23,227
裏がヤバい！裏が！
The back is crazy! The back!

776
00:51:23,327 --> 00:51:25,227
裏面だったからすごい...！
Because it was the back side...

777
00:51:25,427 --> 00:51:27,627
最後イヤだから、まつり行かせてください！
I don't want to go last, so let Matsuri go next!

778
00:51:28,927 --> 00:51:31,227
行っちゃった、行っちゃった！
She already went, she already went!

779
00:51:31,327 --> 00:51:32,627
行っちゃった！
She went!

780
00:51:32,927 --> 00:51:34,627
まつり先輩！
Matsuri-senpai!

781
00:51:34,727 --> 00:51:37,927
行くぞー！3、2、1、ゴー！
Here I go! 3, 2, 1, Go!

782
00:51:38,427 --> 00:51:39,627
行けー！
Go!

783
00:51:39,927 --> 00:51:42,227
お、上手！上手い、上手い！マジ？
Oh, good! Nice, nice! Really?

784
00:51:42,427 --> 00:51:43,927
あ、惜しい！
Ah, close!

785
00:51:45,627 --> 00:51:47,427
ダメなんだ... お！
It didn't count... Oh!

786
00:51:47,527 --> 00:51:49,227
おー！上手い！すごい！
Ooh! So good! Amazing!

787
00:51:52,227 --> 00:51:54,427
あ、今のところ最高だよ、これ！
Ah, this is the best score so far!

788
00:51:54,527 --> 00:51:56,627
そうだよね！2個の時点でね！
Right! Getting 2 targets!

789
00:51:56,727 --> 00:51:58,627
むずいんだから、これ！
Since this is so hard!

790
00:52:02,027 --> 00:52:03,927
狙ってるうちにどんどん時間が過ぎてく！
While aiming, time keeps ticking away!

791
00:52:04,027 --> 00:52:05,627
これ後ろじゃない、後ろじゃない！
This isn't behind, isn't behind!

792
00:52:05,727 --> 00:52:06,927
後ろ！
Behind!

793
00:52:07,027 --> 00:52:08,427
後ろはね...
The back side is...

794
00:52:08,927 --> 00:52:10,927
ヤバい！ヤバいです！
Oh no! This is bad!

795
00:52:11,027 --> 00:52:12,427
ヤバいのではありません！
It's not bad!

796
00:52:12,927 --> 00:52:15,227
100... 2個か！
100... 2 targets, huh!

797
00:52:15,927 --> 00:52:18,927
いや、でも最高だよね！1位だよね！
No, but that's the highest! You're 1st place!

798
00:52:19,027 --> 00:52:20,927
なんかこれ気付いたぞ、トワちゃん。
I noticed something about this, Towa-chan.

799
00:52:21,227 --> 00:52:23,927
うん、追わない方がいい。絶対そう！
Yeah, better not to chase them. Definitely!

800
00:52:24,027 --> 00:52:26,927
トワも思ってた！一点集中！
Towa thought so too! Focus on one spot!

801
00:52:27,027 --> 00:52:29,427
一点集中で、きたとこパーンの方が...
Focus on one spot and shoot when it passes...

802
00:52:29,627 --> 00:52:31,927
アドバイスを活かして、やろうかな！
I'll try using that advice!

803
00:52:32,227 --> 00:52:33,427
イエーイ！
Yay!

804
00:52:33,527 --> 00:52:36,427
トワちゃんの挑戦！3、2、1、ゴー！
Towa-chan's turn! 3, 2, 1, Go!

805
00:52:37,427 --> 00:52:39,227
頑張れ！行けー！
Do your best! Go!

806
00:52:39,427 --> 00:52:42,927
ほい！おー！惜しい！
Hop! Woah! So close!

807
00:52:43,927 --> 00:52:46,427
やば、こっち向け！やばい！
Oh no, face this way! Oh no!

808
00:52:46,527 --> 00:52:49,427
うわー！え、え、え！
Woah! What, what, what?!

809
00:52:49,927 --> 00:52:51,427
あ、裏だ！
Ah, it's the back side!

810
00:52:51,527 --> 00:52:53,627
裏... うわー！
Back... Woah!

811
00:52:53,727 --> 00:52:55,427
頑張れー！
Do your best!

812
00:52:55,527 --> 00:52:57,427
うわ、行けた行けた！あと10秒！
Woah, nice nice! 10 seconds left!

813
00:52:57,627 --> 00:52:59,427
はい！頑張れ！
Yes! Do your best!

814
00:52:59,527 --> 00:53:00,927
タイミング、タイミングだ！
Timing, it's all about timing!

815
00:53:01,027 --> 00:53:03,227
おー！おー！全部裏面！
Woah! Woah! They're all the back side!

816
00:53:03,427 --> 00:53:06,927
3、2、1... ヤバい！
3, 2, 1... Oh no!

817
00:53:07,927 --> 00:53:10,227
いや、これむずいよー！
No, this is so hard!

818
00:53:10,427 --> 00:53:12,927
え、これクソむずいじゃん！1枚でした！
What, this is freaking hard! I got 1 target!

819
00:53:13,427 --> 00:53:15,427
一緒だ、ござると！
Tied with Gozaru!

820
00:53:15,627 --> 00:53:19,227
申し訳ないけど後ろの人と一緒。
Sorry, but I'm tied with the person behind me.

821
00:53:19,427 --> 00:53:21,427
ホントに...
Really...

822
00:53:21,927 --> 00:53:23,927
[Level 3]

823
00:53:24,427 --> 00:53:27,927
普通の標的、動く標的ときて、なんとこちら！ポン！
After normal targets and moving targets, look at this! Bam!

824
00:53:28,427 --> 00:53:31,927
うわー！ゾンビ！
Woah! A zombie!

825
00:53:32,427 --> 00:53:34,427
きもい、きもい！怖いよ！
Gross, gross! So scary!

826
00:53:34,627 --> 00:53:39,427
ゾンビの動く標的になってます！
It's a moving zombie target!

827
00:53:39,627 --> 00:53:42,427
でも標的自体は2つしかないから！確かに！
But there are only two targets on it! True!

828
00:53:42,527 --> 00:53:46,427
こちらを狙って... なんか気持ち悪いポーズもしてますけど...
Aim for these... though it's making weird poses...

829
00:53:47,227 --> 00:53:49,927
こいつ自我があるぞ！自我が！
This guy has a mind of its own! A mind!

830
00:53:50,227 --> 00:53:51,427
トワちゃんから、じゃあ行きましょう！
Starting with Towa-chan, let's go!

831
00:53:51,927 --> 00:53:54,427
3、2、1、ゴー！
3, 2, 1, Go!

832
00:53:55,427 --> 00:53:57,927
え、なんか... うわ！
Wait, what... Woah!

833
00:53:58,427 --> 00:54:01,227
え、ごめん！イージー、イージー！
Wait, sorry! Easy, easy!

834
00:54:01,427 --> 00:54:05,427
あ、でもなんか... おい！おい！こっち向け！こっち向け！
Ah, but wait... Hey! Hey! Look over here! Look over here!

835
00:54:06,227 --> 00:54:08,927
やばい！いや、ちょっと待って！
Oh no! No, wait a second!

836
00:54:09,427 --> 00:54:11,927
待って、やばい、やばい！
Wait, oh no, oh no!

837
00:54:12,227 --> 00:54:15,927
頭の... 頭の... 変わるんだ！
On its head... its head... It changes!

838
00:54:16,427 --> 00:54:19,427
やばい！おい！
Oh no! Hey!

839
00:54:19,927 --> 00:54:22,927
でも... キモいポーズだ！
But... what a gross pose!

840
00:54:23,027 --> 00:54:24,927
頑張れ！
Do your best!

841
00:54:25,427 --> 00:54:28,927
よし！クリア！
Alright! Clear!

842
00:54:29,427 --> 00:54:32,927
え、ギリギリだったん... 2つちゃんと割れました！ありがとうございます！
Eh, that was close... both cracked properly! Thank you!

843
00:54:34,927 --> 00:54:39,927
なんかゾンビがたまに自我を持ち始めて不思議な動きをするので皆さま注意を
Sometimes the zombie starts having a mind of its own and makes strange moves, so please be careful everyone.

844
00:54:40,927 --> 00:54:43,927
行きたい、行きたい！じゃあ、まつりちゃんね！
I want to go, I want to go! Okay, Matsuri-chan then!

845
00:54:44,027 --> 00:54:45,427
頑張るぞ！
I'll do my best!

846
00:54:45,527 --> 00:54:47,427
夏色まつりちゃん！
Natsuiro Matsuri-chan!

847
00:54:47,527 --> 00:54:49,927
はい！3、2、1、どうぞ！
Okay! 3, 2, 1, go ahead!

848
00:54:50,427 --> 00:54:52,927
早っ！速い、速い、速い！
So fast! Fast, fast, fast!

849
00:54:53,427 --> 00:54:56,227
え！え！
What! What!

850
00:54:56,427 --> 00:54:57,927
はやっ！
So fast!

851
00:54:58,027 --> 00:54:59,927
3秒で終わりました！
It ended in 3 seconds!

852
00:55:00,027 --> 00:55:01,427
3秒！
3 seconds!

853
00:55:03,468 --> 00:55:04,668
ダメー！
Nooo!

854
00:55:05,668 --> 00:55:07,668
落ち込んでるよ！
He's getting depressed!

855
00:55:10,668 --> 00:55:12,168
やっちゃった、やっちゃった！
I did it, I did it!

856
00:55:12,368 --> 00:55:15,668
今まつりちゃんが3秒で撃ち抜いちゃったということは
Now that Matsuri-chan shot it down in 3 seconds,

857
00:55:15,768 --> 00:55:20,168
たぶんもう次のゾンビは「この動きしちゃいけないな」って風になって...
the next zombie will probably learn, "I shouldn't move like this"...

858
00:55:20,368 --> 00:55:21,968
やばい、学習するタイプだ！
Oh no, it's the type that learns!

859
00:55:22,168 --> 00:55:23,968
学習ゾンビなんだ！
It's a learning zombie!

860
00:55:24,168 --> 00:55:25,668
ちょっと待って、じゃあ先やる？
Wait a sec, should I go first?

861
00:55:25,768 --> 00:55:27,668
先にやる！先にやる！
I'll go first! I'll go first!

862
00:55:27,768 --> 00:55:30,168
でもさ、主役が最後でしょ！
But the star is supposed to go last!

863
00:55:31,968 --> 00:55:34,168
3, 2, 1, スタート！
3, 2, 1, Start!

864
00:55:38,668 --> 00:55:40,368
当たるんかい！
It hits, really?!

865
00:55:40,968 --> 00:55:42,968
なんで当たるんだよ！
Why is it hitting?!

866
00:55:49,168 --> 00:55:50,968
頭抜けるよね！
Its head dodges it!

867
00:55:53,968 --> 00:55:55,468
撃ちなさい！
Shoot it!

868
00:55:55,668 --> 00:55:57,168
当たりそう！当たりそう！
It's about to hit!

869
00:55:59,368 --> 00:56:01,168
あと5秒ね！
5 seconds left!

870
00:56:06,968 --> 00:56:08,968
やばい、途中我慢できなかった！
Oh no, I couldn't hold back halfway through!

871
00:56:09,668 --> 00:56:11,668
むかつきすぎて！
Because it was so annoying!

872
00:56:11,968 --> 00:56:15,968
最後の挑戦者はゼータ！ 3, 2, 1, スタート！
The final challenger is Zeta! 3, 2, 1, Start!

873
00:56:18,968 --> 00:56:20,968
めっちゃ動いてる！
It's moving so much!

874
00:56:23,368 --> 00:56:25,168
めっちゃ動いてるよ！
It's really moving!

875
00:56:26,168 --> 00:56:28,168
助けて！
Help me!

876
00:56:37,668 --> 00:56:39,168
すごかった！本当！
That was amazing! Truly!

877
00:56:39,668 --> 00:56:42,168
めちゃめちゃ軽い動きだった！
Her movement was so nimble!

878
00:56:42,968 --> 00:56:46,368
2ポイントです！ わー！ すごーい！
That's 2 points! Woah! Amazing!

879
00:56:47,168 --> 00:56:51,168
みんなー！ このテストで一番ポイントを取ったのは誰か、見てみようか？！
Guys! Should we see who got the most points in this test?!

880
00:56:52,368 --> 00:56:54,168
おー！
Woah!

881
00:56:54,368 --> 00:56:56,668
めっちゃいい勝負！
It's such a close match!

882
00:56:57,968 --> 00:57:00,368
え、まつりが12点。
Matsuri has 12 points.

883
00:57:00,668 --> 00:57:02,968
で、トワちゃんが11点。
And Towa-chan has 11 points.

884
00:57:03,168 --> 00:57:05,168
で、ゼータが10点。
And Zeta has 10 points.

885
00:57:05,368 --> 00:57:07,968
そしてラプラスが 4点！
And La+ has 4 points!

886
00:57:08,168 --> 00:57:10,668
4点！ 4点！
4 points! 4 points!

887
00:57:11,168 --> 00:57:13,168
ラプラスが最下位！
La+ is in last place!

888
00:57:13,668 --> 00:57:16,168
1位までは1位の方へ選んでよ！
Pick the one who came in 1st place!

889
00:57:17,168 --> 00:57:19,968
すごーい！おめでとー！
Wooow! Congrats!

890
00:57:20,168 --> 00:57:22,168
みんなほんとによく頑張ったね！
You guys did very well!

891
00:57:22,268 --> 00:57:25,668
でも何より、みんなが楽しんでくれて嬉しかった。
And best of all, I'm glad everyone had fun.

892
00:57:25,968 --> 00:57:30,968
これからもっとエイム力を上げて、こぼみたいにうまくなれるといいね。
I can't wait to see how much more you can improve your aiming skills in the future, like me.

893
00:57:33,168 --> 00:57:34,168
おい！
Oi.

894
00:57:35,168 --> 00:57:37,168
ちょっと......こっちが喋ってるんだけど？
Um, I'm... I'm talking here.

895
00:57:37,368 --> 00:57:39,968
おい！ こぼの話を聞いてよ！
Oi! Listen to Kobo!

896
00:57:40,668 --> 00:57:47,168
ま、とにかくゼータ！ シークレット・エージェントになれるまで まだまだ遠〜い道のりだよ？いい？
Anyway, Zeta! You still have a long, long way to go to become a full-fledged secret agent, okay?

897
00:57:48,168 --> 00:57:50,668
うん、勝負しょっ！
Yeah, let's have a match one day!

898
00:57:50,968 --> 00:57:53,668
バーイ！またね〜
Bye! See ya~

899
00:57:56,168 --> 00:58:00,168
まだ勝負ついてないよ！
It's not over yet!

900
00:58:02,168 --> 00:58:06,668
こぼからね！逃げた！逃げた！
From Kobo! She ran away! She ran away!

901
00:58:16,668 --> 00:58:24,168
That was such a crazy... I got wet! Look at that, from the water gun!

902
00:58:25,168 --> 00:58:30,168
They were shooting at me like crazy. I even had to change my clothes.

903
00:58:32,168 --> 00:58:39,168
But I heard there's gonna be announcements today. So are you guys ready for the announcements?

904
00:58:39,368 --> 00:58:41,668
A little ad break, yes?

905
00:58:42,168 --> 00:58:47,168
では、告知です！ お願いします！
Now then, here is an announcement! Please!

906
00:58:48,168 --> 00:58:53,168
じゃじゃーん！ うわー、水着！
Tada! Woah, swimsuit!

907
00:58:53,668 --> 00:58:56,968
She's shining, she's shining so bright!

908
00:58:57,168 --> 00:59:02,168
Oh my god! Zeta in an angel-like outfit! Isn't that so cute?

909
00:59:02,368 --> 00:59:07,168
Angel costume! You guys have always said that you're scared of me, so...

910
00:59:07,368 --> 00:59:11,668
...you can't be scared of me now, cause...

911
00:59:11,768 --> 00:59:16,168
...I'm the most seiso person there is! So...

912
00:59:16,368 --> 00:59:20,168
清楚ゼータ！ 清楚ゼータ来た！
Seiso Zeta! Seiso Zeta is here!

913
00:59:20,368 --> 00:59:22,668
どう？ かわいい？
How is it? Cute?

914
00:59:22,968 --> 00:59:25,168
かわいいんでしょう？ 真白だし。
It's cute, right? It's pure white.

915
00:59:25,368 --> 00:59:27,668
The costume looks so cute, right?

916
00:59:28,168 --> 00:59:32,168
Beli berapa kan, guys? Karena kapan lagi bisa lihat Seiso Zeta ya, guys, ya?
How many will you buy, guys? Because when else can you see Seiso Zeta, guys?

917
00:59:32,968 --> 00:59:37,168
Berkostum, berkosplay sebagai angel-angel gitu. Lucu! Iya, iya, Zeta lucu, lucu.
Dressed up, cosplaying as an angel like that. Cute! Yes, yes, Zeta is so cute.

918
00:59:37,368 --> 00:59:42,168
Aku mau! Siapa yang mau? Aku! Aku!
I want it! Who wants it? Me! Me!

919
00:59:43,668 --> 00:59:46,368
But we don't stop here, because...

920
00:59:46,668 --> 00:59:52,168
...obviously, there's gonna be so many more items and we're gonna introduce them now.

921
00:59:52,368 --> 00:59:55,968
じゃ、こちらをご覧ください！ どうぞ！
Now then, please take a look at this! Go ahead!

922
00:59:56,168 --> 00:59:57,668
じゃじゃーん！
Tada!

923
00:59:58,168 --> 01:00:01,968
I'm bad at counting, but that's probably six, right? Isn't that so awesome?!

924
01:00:02,176 --> 01:00:03,976
That's so cool!

925
01:00:03,976 --> 01:00:06,076
So we have acrylic diorama...

926
01:00:06,076 --> 01:00:09,576
...which you can put on your table. Later we'll explain.

927
01:00:09,576 --> 01:00:12,376
And then we have a cap. No cap, okay.

928
01:00:12,376 --> 01:00:15,376
We have a plushie, ぬいぐるみ!
We have a plushie, a plushie!

929
01:00:15,376 --> 01:00:18,276
And not only that, there will of course be Voice...

930
01:00:18,276 --> 01:00:22,276
Sorry, why did I say Voice? There will be Voice Pack...

931
01:00:22,276 --> 01:00:25,176
...and also bonus card as well!

932
01:00:25,176 --> 01:00:29,676
Who wants bonus cards? Me!

933
01:00:30,676 --> 01:00:34,076
So I bet you guys are interested in this! Yeah, definitely!

934
01:00:34,176 --> 01:00:36,676
Kalau kalian tertarik bakal ada 6 item ya guys,
If you're interested, there will be 6 items guys:

935
01:00:36,676 --> 01:00:39,976
acrylic diorama, haori, kucing... eh, kucing...
acrylic diorama, haori, cat... I mean, cat...

936
01:00:39,976 --> 01:00:43,676
Ada topi, ada juga boneka...
There's a cap, there's also a plushie...

937
01:00:43,676 --> 01:00:47,176
いっぱいありますよね。
There are a lot, right?

938
01:00:47,176 --> 01:00:51,176
Bonus card, this is also bonus card, so yeah!

939
01:00:51,176 --> 01:00:55,176
Definitely, um, we're gonna get into it, but stay, stay there.

940
01:00:55,176 --> 01:00:58,676
We're not, we're not done yet. We're not done yet.

941
01:00:58,676 --> 01:01:00,176
はい、次どうぞ！
Okay, next please!

942
01:01:01,676 --> 01:01:04,676
じゃじゃーん！
Tada!

943
01:01:04,676 --> 01:01:07,676
This is my acrylic diorama!

944
01:01:07,676 --> 01:01:10,976
So cute! あるてらママ先生、
So cute! Arutera Mama-sensei,

945
01:01:10,976 --> 01:01:13,676
Thank you so much, sensei!

946
01:01:13,676 --> 01:01:16,676
ママありがとう！
Mama, thank you!

947
01:01:17,676 --> 01:01:20,676
Mama's drawing is always so cute! 可愛いでしょうね。
Mama's drawing is always so cute! It's cute, right?

948
01:01:20,676 --> 01:01:23,176
可愛い。
Cute.

949
01:01:23,176 --> 01:01:25,176
じっと飛んでるよ。
It's floating silently.

950
01:01:25,176 --> 01:01:27,176
凄くない？
Isn't it amazing?

951
01:01:27,176 --> 01:01:30,176
It's super duper cute!

952
01:01:30,676 --> 01:01:33,976
I'm having an... I was, I almost said allergic reaction.

953
01:01:34,176 --> 01:01:37,176
I am having...

954
01:01:37,176 --> 01:01:40,176
...you know that cuteness aggression? Yeah.

955
01:01:40,176 --> 01:01:43,176
That's what I'm feeling. It's so cute!

956
01:01:43,176 --> 01:01:45,176
Okay!

957
01:01:45,176 --> 01:01:50,176
Of course we're gonna, um, go to the next one. There's so much more.

958
01:01:50,676 --> 01:01:52,176
じゃ、次どうぞ！
Well, next please!

959
01:01:52,676 --> 01:01:55,976
じゃじゃーん！
Tada!

960
01:01:56,176 --> 01:01:59,176
なんだと？！羽織？！
What?! Haori?!

961
01:01:59,176 --> 01:02:02,176
Vestia Zeta Haori!

962
01:02:02,176 --> 01:02:06,176
I know that you guys would love to wear this at, like, events,

963
01:02:06,176 --> 01:02:09,676
or like concerts, or maybe, you know, for...

964
01:02:09,676 --> 01:02:13,976
...for future Fes, uh, next Fes. I mean...

965
01:02:14,676 --> 01:02:18,176
You guys can wear it together! You can, like...

966
01:02:18,176 --> 01:02:21,176
...huddle up, wear the same Haori,

967
01:02:21,176 --> 01:02:23,676
and it would be so cute, right?

968
01:02:23,676 --> 01:02:26,176
I mean, I'm wearing a uniform, so you guys can be...

969
01:02:26,176 --> 01:02:29,676
...this can be your uniform.

970
01:02:30,176 --> 01:02:32,176
ライブの時とか、
During concerts and such,

971
01:02:32,176 --> 01:02:34,176
そう、可愛いでしょう？
yeah, it's cute, right?

972
01:02:34,176 --> 01:02:37,676
Like if everyone like wears it together, it's gonna be so cute.

973
01:02:37,676 --> 01:02:39,676
Lucu banget guys, Haori.
It's super cute guys, Haori.

974
01:02:39,676 --> 01:02:42,676
Aku nggak tahu mau ngomong apa, pokoknya ini keren banget!
I don't know what to say, basically this is super cool!

975
01:02:42,676 --> 01:02:45,676
Karena desainnya tuh pertama simpel, terus belakangnya tuh kelihatan Zeta.
Because first, the design is simple, then the back looks like Zeta.

976
01:02:45,676 --> 01:02:48,176
Terus... nggak norak gitu loh guys!
Also... it's not tacky at all, guys!

977
